  "label": "Star Wars Jedi Force",
  "description": "The phrase 'I felt a great disturbance in the force' is a famous line from the Star Wars franchise, spoken by the Jedi Master Obi-Wan Kenobi. It refers to the mystical energy field that surrounds all living things, which Jedi and Sith can sense and manipulate. This concept is central to the Star Wars universe and is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme's reference.",
